{"id":2335,"date":"2024-09-19T12:35:23","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:35:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2335"},"modified":"2025-10-02T11:10:58","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T11:10:58","slug":"cardboard-gift-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-gift-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Gift Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Empty Cardboard Gift Boxes Ready for Customization<\/h2>\n<p>Looking for premium gift packaging that\u2019s affordable and easy to customize? At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a>, we offer custom <strong>cardboard gift boxes<\/strong> at wholesale prices for all your packaging needs. Whether you\u2019re wrapping delicate items, promotional giveaways, or holiday collections, we provide high-quality materials, custom sizes, and fast turnaround times.<\/p>\n<p>Our boxes are available in multiple styles and finishes, from minimal designs to full-color prints. You can also request <strong>cardboard gift boxes empty<\/strong> or printed, depending on your brand\u2019s packaging plan.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Our Cardboard Gift Boxes Are in Demand<\/h2>\n<h3>Wide Range of Sizes and Styles<\/h3>\n<p>We manufacture <strong>large cardboard gift boxes<\/strong>, small-sized options, and everything in between. Whether you need single-item packaging or boxes for bundled product sets, we can create the right size and shape for your requirements.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flat-pack boxes for easy shipping<\/li>\n<li>Two-piece boxes for premium presentation<\/li>\n<li>Tuck end and mailer styles available<\/li>\n<li>Lid and sleeve options for secure closure<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Each box is die-cut to precision and shipped flat or assembled based on your preference.<\/p>\n<h3>High-Quality Material and Finish Options<\/h3>\n<p>We use durable and attractive materials to ensure your packaging is both secure and presentable.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrugated board for strength<\/li>\n<li>Eco-friendly Kraft paper for a natural look<\/li>\n<li>White SBS board for high-end printing<\/li>\n<li>Cardstock for lightweight packaging<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>All materials are recyclable and safe for direct contact with non-food products.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Gift Boxes with Lids and More<\/h2>\n<h3>Styles That Add Value to Your Product Presentation<\/h3>\n<p>Looking to offer more secure and sleek packaging? Our <strong>cardboard gift boxes with lids<\/strong> are designed to keep items safe while offering a professional finish.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Two-piece boxes with separate lids<\/li>\n<li>Magnetic closure lid boxes for a cleaner look<\/li>\n<li>Lid styles with ribbon ties or tab closures<\/li>\n<li>Optional clear windows for product visibility<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re selling jewelry, accessories, candles, or promotional sets, these boxes leave a lasting impression.<\/p>\n<h3>Custom Finishing Options<\/h3>\n<p>We offer multiple coating and surface options to suit your brand style or campaign.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss finish for a bright and clean look<\/li>\n<li>Matte finish for soft texture and less glare<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV for highlighting logos or designs<\/li>\n<li>Foil stamping in gold, silver, or custom colors<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If your business deals with items that fall under beauty, wellness, or gift packaging, we also recommend exploring our wide range of solutions under <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cosmetic-and-gift-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"479\"><strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"394\">Cosmetic and Gift Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>. These boxes are commonly used for packaging perfumes, skincare kits, luxury candles, and gift sets\u2014offering structure, presentation, and brand consistency across all touchpoints.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<table style=\"height: 365px;\" width=\"775\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sizes<\/td>\n<td>All Custom Sizes \u2013 Small to Large Cardboard Gift Boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated Board, White SBS, Eco Kraft, Cardstock<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Finishes<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Methods<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Digital, Offset, Foil, Embossing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lid Styles<\/td>\n<td>Magnetic Lid, Two-Piece, Sleeve and Lid, Tuck-In Lid<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Styles<\/td>\n<td>Mailer, Tuck End, Drawer, Pillow, Gable<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Quantity<\/td>\n<td>100 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Proof Options<\/td>\n<td>3D Mockup, Flat View, Physical Sample<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days (Rush Options Available)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Shipping Nationwide<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Support<\/td>\n<td>Free Artwork Setup and Layout Assistance<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Gift Boxes Wholesale Benefits<\/h2>\n<h3>Bulk Orders at Affordable Rates<\/h3>\n<p>Buying <strong>cardboard gift boxes wholesale<\/strong> allows you to meet packaging needs while keeping costs low. Whether you\u2019re a retailer, e-commerce brand, or event planner, wholesale boxes give you more flexibility and value.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lower cost per unit on bulk orders<\/li>\n<li>Consistent box sizing and quality across all units<\/li>\n<li>Easier inventory planning for seasonal packaging<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Suitable for Multiple Industries<\/h3>\n<p>Our boxes are used across different sectors such as:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Cosmetics and skincare<\/li>\n<li>Apparel and accessories<\/li>\n<li>Event giveaways and promotions<\/li>\n<li>Subscription boxes<\/li>\n<li>Corporate gift packaging<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>These are ideal options if you&#8217;re searching for <strong>cheap gift boxes wholesale<\/strong> without compromising on material quality.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>More Features That Make a Difference<\/h2>\n<h3>Interior Printing and Inserts<\/h3>\n<p>Want to enhance your unboxing experience? We also offer custom internal printing and insert trays.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add slogans or patterns to the inside of the lid<\/li>\n<li>Insert die-cut holders for candles, bottles, or items<\/li>\n<li>Use foam or cardboard inserts to separate fragile items<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These customizations help you pack smarter and display better. Many clients who need folded boxes for skincare, perfumes, or beauty products also use our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-cosmetic-packaging\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"839\"><strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"768\">Cardboard Cosmetic Packaging<\/strong><\/a> to maintain branding consistency across multiple product lines.<\/p>\n<h3>Eco-Friendly Packaging Solutions<\/h3>\n<p>If sustainability matters to your brand, we\u2019ve got you covered. Our <strong>cardboard gift boxes empty<\/strong> can be made using biodegradable or recycled materials. We also use eco-safe inks and coatings in all print jobs.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Easy Steps to Place Your Order<\/h2>\n<h3>Get Started with Just a Few Clicks<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose your box style and dimensions<\/li>\n<li>Select printing, coating, and lid preferences<\/li>\n<li>Upload your artwork or request free design help<\/li>\n<li>Approve the digital proof (3D or flat view)<\/li>\n<li>Receive your boxes within a few business days<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Need help choosing the right type of box? Our support team is always ready to guide you.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom sizes and styles made to order<\/li>\n<li>Affordable <strong>cardboard gift boxes wholesale<\/strong> pricing<\/li>\n<li>Coating options: Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Free design support and layout assistance<\/li>\n<li>Fast turnaround times and shipping<\/li>\n<li>Eco-friendly, recyclable materials<\/li>\n<li>Consistent quality from 100 to 500,000+ units<\/li>\n<li>3D mockups and samples available<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers high-quality cardboard gift boxes at wholesale prices, perfect for a wide range of packaging needs. We offer various sizes, styles, and coating options like gloss, matte, and spot UV. Get free design and shipping with your order. Order today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2454,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[184],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2335","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cosmetic-and-gift-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Get Custom Cardboard Gift Packaging, Wholesale<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Buy wholesale cardboard gift boxes at competitive prices. Ideal for businesses and retailers. Bulk discounts available. Order Now.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-gift-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Get Custom Cardboard Gift Packaging, Wholesale\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Buy wholesale cardboard gift boxes at competitive prices. Ideal for businesses and retailers. Bulk discounts available. Order Now.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"